baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 유저 프로필 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/1

### 내 프로필 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 회원 탈퇴
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "password1!"
}

### 알림 설정 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 알림 수신 설정 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/settings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isOutbidEnabled": false,
  "isAuctionStartEnabled": true,
  "isMarketingEnabled": false
}

### GP/AP 잔액 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 나의 영토 목록 조회
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/territories?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 닉네임 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/nickname
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "새닉네임"
}

### 비밀번호 변경
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "password1!",
  "newPassword": "newPassword1!"
}
